  "root_contracts": [
    "Unread UI uses the actual Book.unread source consistent with actual SQL/controller sorting/filtering/read changes; do not fabricate counts or infer production behavior from a demo fixture.",
    "Selected source and shortcuts must visibly identify the actual same-name/correct-namespace source, including distinguishing00/01 and hidden More selection; preserve input and truthful current query state.",
    "Scribe six-result identity uses the approved long two-line title/author treatment and distinct actual book tiles inside existing bounds. Short titles may remain short. Read actual title/suffix/author from PNG, not merely state.",
    "A failed title-pixel assertion is not by itself product proof; independently look at actual current words/lines/occlusion and then state the evidence. No lower standards or rewritten initial failure.",
    "Existing editing local-preview, numeric direction HANDOFF wording, truthful unavailable/fixed-on and Reader render/input snapshot contracts are not reopened as feature requests."
  ],
